Flow Bootstrap conversation

  Screen Conversation
    Shows
      Conversation error with retry when response generation fails

  Action Generate initial assistant response

    Receives
      Shopping session
      Conversation context
      Combined dimension prompt

    Rules
      Use the combined dimension prompt as instruction context

    Uses
      Provider OpenAI
      Model GPT-5
      Reasoning effort high

    Steps
      Generate the initial assistant response

    If generating the response fails
      Make a retry available

    Outcome
      Initial assistant response is available
